<title>HONG KONG: EIB sets HK$500 mln seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets HK$500 mln seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by sole arranger Societe Generale Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  HK$500 MLN  COUPON     7.27 PCT  MATURITY 23.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FIXED RATE  ISS PRICE  100.20    PAY DATE 23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY   AAA	 REOFFER    --	  LAUNCH   27.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P     AAA	 SPREAD     34 BP     DENOMS   HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> LISTING	HK				     PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS  STANDARD  HOME CTRY SUPRANAT'L GOV LAW  ENGLISH</p>
<p> FULL FEES    20BP FLAT COMBINED</p>
<p> NOTES	  REDEMPTION AT PAR</p>
<p>		**PRICED TO YIELD 34 BP OVER COMPARABLE HONG KONG</p>
<p>		  GOV'T EFN NOTES</p>
<p>	     ***YIELD TO INVESTOR 7.432 PERCENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
